    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Armoured Infantry",
    "summary": "**On My Signal** can be issued only to **ARMOURED SKIRMISHER** units. Whenever an enemy unit finishes a [normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) or [advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) up to 8\" from the unit with this [Order](vsdata:ability/astra-militarum.voice-of-command), that unit can move up to D6\" in a [normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move). A unit can make this move only once per turn.",
